title: September 2020

@czajka_2020
# prose-audit: Grade A — The scene separates the collector failure, emergency discharge and repair from the personalised meme, then makes Lewica choose between scrutiny, opposition solidarity and opportunism.
title: Trzaskowski shits into the river
subtitle: Czajka fails for a second year, and a municipal breakdown becomes a verdict on KO
face-image: img/poland/events/pres-candidate-trzaskowski.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.czajka_2020_done = 1;
Q.czajka_meme_reach =
    (Number(Q.czajka_meme_reach) || 0) +
    (Q.trz_inaugurated ? 8 : 5);
Q.ko_poll_momentum =
    (Number(Q.ko_poll_momentum) || 0) -
    (Q.trz_inaugurated ? 1.0 : 0.7);
Q.climate_policy_pressure =
    (Number(Q.climate_policy_pressure) || 0) + 3;
Q.trz_right_backlash =
    (Number(Q.trz_right_backlash) || 0) +
    (Q.trz_inaugurated ? 4 : 0);
Q.news_headline =
    "The Czajka failure becomes a national verdict on Trzaskowski";
!}

= September 2020 — The river carries the opposition's name

On 29 August the collector system carrying sewage from left-bank Warsaw
beneath the Vistula fails again. Wastewater can no longer reach the **Czajka treatment
plant**. The city mechanically screens and ozonates it, then discharges it
straight into the river while the army prepares a pontoon bridge for an
emergency pipeline. MPWiK puts the first repair stage above forty million
złoty and says the temporary pipes may take about three weeks.

The system was chosen before **Rafał Trzaskowski** became mayor. The first
collector failure, however, happened under him only a year ago. During the
June presidential campaign he had also dismissed questions about a separate
storm-overflow discharge as electoral manipulation. That clip returns now,
stripped of the distinction between an authorised overflow, a broken
collector and raw sewage.

The technical account takes minutes. The meme takes four words:
**Trzaskowski shits into the river.** It is false as a description of what one
man did and effective as a description of whom voters blame.

[? if trz_inaugurated = 1: Trzaskowski has already exchanged City Hall for the
Presidential Palace. The infrastructure remains Warsaw's responsibility, but
KO's victory means its first presidential month smells of a failure built
under its new head of state.?]
[? if trz_inaugurated = 0 and trz_repeat_election_pending = 0: Trzaskowski remains the capital's mayor and KO's
most recent presidential candidate. The failure stays municipal on paper and
national in every broadcast.?]
[? if trz_repeat_election_pending = 1: Trzaskowski's oath has been blocked and
he is being forced into another presidential campaign. Czajka gives the right
a material scandal to place beside its constitutional one.?]

- @czajka_audit
- @czajka_defend
- @czajka_meme

