We repeat the water-test results, the mechanical treatment and the fact that
the collector design predates Trzaskowski. KO welcomes the common front and
puts our experts beside its spokespeople.

The facts blunt the most lurid version. They do not explain why the same
critical route failed twice. By defending Trzaskowski before demanding that
answer, we teach viewers to treat the failure as ours too.

