Our accounts put Trzaskowski's face over the outfall before the government can
claim the image for itself. The line is brutal, memorable and good for a small
polling transfer from a wounded rival.

It also makes the engineering record politically useless. When the water
tests, old design and emergency works appear, we dismiss them as excuses
because the joke requires us to. PiS and Konfederacja keep the larger audience
for that kind of politics; we have helped make its language normal.

