!}

We vote for it because it is right, and we say so without pretending the vote
is anything other than what it is. Fur farming ends. The United Right spends
the following month suspending its own deputies and negotiating with tractors.

In the counties, the arithmetic is remembered differently: the party that talks
about workers voted to close the farms and left the compensation to the people
who opposed the bill.

