Kaczyński needs the votes and we have them. The price is written down: a
measure the government has refused for a year, delivered in the same session,
in exchange for carrying a bill his own deputies will not.

The bill passes and the concession is real. So is the photograph of a Left
caucus negotiating with PiS, which Razem and our progressive organisers will
be answering for at every meeting until the merger congress.

