@fiore_braun_2020
# prose-audit: Grade B — The meeting is treated as an organisational fact rather than an outrage: the conviction, the Moscow doctrine and the beneficiary inside Konfederacja are all named, and every route states which of the two threats it answers and which one it leaves standing. The audience that filled the room is still a category rather than a constituency.
title: A guest from Forza Nuova
subtitle: Braun shares a Warsaw platform with an Italian neofascist and the recording goes online
face-image: img/poland/events/grzegorz-braun-2025.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.fiore_braun_2020_done = 1;
Q.far_right_agenda = (Number(Q.far_right_agenda) || 32) + 3;
Q.russian_influence_salience =
    (Number(Q.russian_influence_salience) || 0) + 4;
// Who holds the Palace in September 2020 changes what this meeting means and
// who has to answer for it, so the branch is resolved once here instead of
// being re-derived in every route.
const fiorePresident = String(Q.president_name || "Andrzej Duda");
Q.fiore_palace = Q.left_president
    ? "left"
    : (fiorePresident == "Andrzej Duda"
        ? "duda"
        : (fiorePresident == "Rafał Trzaskowski"
            ? "trzaskowski"
            : (Q.trz_repeat_election_pending ||
                fiorePresident.indexOf("acting") >= 0 ||
                fiorePresident.indexOf("disputed") >= 0
                ? "interregnum"
                : (String(Q.pres_runoff_winner_key || "") == "bosak"
                    ? "bosak"
                    : "centrist"))));
Q.news_headline =
    "A convicted Italian neofascist shares a Warsaw platform with a Konfederacja deputy";
!}

= September 2020 — A rosary and a Kalashnikov

On 26 August, at the Centrum Edukacyjne Polska in Warsaw, <span class="party-konf"><b>Grzegorz Braun</b></span>
sat at one table with **Roberto Fiore**, founder and leader of the Italian
neofascist party Forza Nuova. The meeting was open to the public, it was
filmed, and the recording is now circulating. Asked whether Konfederacja and
Forza Nuova might work together, Braun answered that the meeting was already
scandalous enough to count as a promising beginning.

Fiore does not conceal what he is. His father was a fascist, his godfather was
Giorgio Almirante of the post-fascist MSI, and Benito is his sixth given name.
In the 1980s he was charged over the Bologna station bombing that killed
eighty-five people; he was acquitted of the bombing itself and convicted of
membership of an armed organisation, and he served none of the five years,
because he was already in Britain and stayed there until the sentence lapsed in
1999. He built the International Third Position with Nick Griffin, founded
Forza Nuova in 1997, and sat in the European Parliament in 2008 and 2009 on
Alessandra Mussolini's seat.

He has been here before: the 11 November marches, and a 2015 Wrocław conference
alongside Alexey Komov of the Russian World Congress of Families network. In
Warsaw he repeated the doctrine he took to St Petersburg that same year. Europe
runs to Siberia, not to the Urals; the symbol is three Romes, the third of them
Moscow; and Moscow is the guardian of the Christian values Brussels has
abandoned. Poland, he said, is the key to Europe's rebirth, and the Independence
Marches are one of its clearest signs. He is against the European Union in its
present form and cheerfully intends to keep drawing on its structures and its
money, because his party is officially recognised inside it. In July he
congratulated <span class="party-konf"><b>Krzysztof Bosak</b></span> on the presidential result, and what he
took from that result is on the record.

[? if fiore_palace = "duda": Bosak's voters, he argued, are the reason the
Palace will hold an anti-EU and pro-family line for another five years. On this
result he is not obviously wrong, which is the uncomfortable part.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "trzaskowski": Bosak's voters, he argued, are what a
right-wing Palace cannot govern without — and this year that Palace was lost
anyway. Cohabitation in Warsaw is already being used by the Italian right as
proof that a conservatism without a spiritual revolution loses.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "left": Bosak's voters, he argued, are what the old right
could not hold, and the Palace has gone to us. He treats a Left presidency as
the clarifying defeat his awakening needs, which means the president in his
argument is ours.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "bosak": That congratulation went to a President-elect.
Forza Nuova's leader is sitting in a Warsaw hall with the closest political
neighbour of the man who now holds the Palace, and the Polish radical right no
longer has to argue that it is on the way somewhere.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "centrist": Bosak's voters, he argued, are what the old
right could not hold, and the Palace has gone to the centre instead. A centrist
president is not a defeat in his account; it is the vacuum before the
awakening.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "interregnum": He is saying this into a country that does
not currently know who its President is. An oath left unsworn is the exact
condition his politics is built for, and he does not pretend otherwise.?]

Braun noted a catalogue of disagreements, the East among them, and continued the
conversation anyway. On Brussels he supplied the line the clips will use: not a
centre, a vacuum, a Brussels death star, a black hole. On the present age he
supplied the other one — that a man today needs a rosary, and a Kalashnikov.

There are two stories in the recording and they do not point the same way. One
is a Sejm deputy sitting with a man convicted of belonging to an armed
organisation. The other is a radical right that has just been told, in Polish,
on camera, that its future runs through Moscow — which is not what the
nationalist half of Konfederacja tells its own voters.

- @fiore_prosecutors
- @fiore_moscow
- @fiore_communities
- @fiore_ignore

@fiore_prosecutors
title: Put the recording in front of the prosecutors and the Sejm's own procedure
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Builds a documented file on Braun that this prosecution service will not act on.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: A referral that survives contact with Ziobro's prosecutors has to be drafted properly, and the caucus has no capacity this month.
