Q.fiore_2020_response = "Referral and procedure";
Q.braun_legal_preparation =
    (Number(Q.braun_legal_preparation) || 0) + 6;
Q.constitutional_restraint =
    (Number(Q.constitutional_restraint) || 0) + 3;
Q.minority_safety = (Number(Q.minority_safety) || 56) + 3;
Q.far_right_fragmentation =
    (Number(Q.far_right_fragmentation) || 0) + 3;
Q.braun_martyrdom = (Number(Q.braun_martyrdom) || 0) + 1;
Q.konf_braunist_share = (Number(Q.konf_braunist_share) || 0) + 2;
Q.konf_mentzenite_share = (Number(Q.konf_mentzenite_share) || 0) - 1;
Q.konf_nationalist_share = (Number(Q.konf_nationalist_share) || 0) - 1;
Q.konf_relation = (Number(Q.konf_relation) || 0) - 6;
Q.public_trust = (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0) + 1;
Q.media_capacity = (Number(Q.media_capacity) || 0) + 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left asks who invited a convicted terrorist organiser into a Warsaw hall";
!}

The referral is narrow and citable: the conviction, the visa-free entry, the
public hall, the deputy who hosted him, and the sentence about the Kalashnikov
spoken by a member of the Sejm. We ask the prosecution service what it intends
to do and we ask the Marshal's office under what standard a deputy's public
events are held.

Nothing happens. The prosecution service answers to <span class="party-pis"><b>Zbigniew Ziobro</b></span>,
who is Prosecutor General as well as justice minister and does not require
anybody's countersignature to do nothing, and Braun spends a fortnight being
persecuted on camera, which is the role he came for.

[? if fiore_palace = "duda": The Palace has nothing to say about it either.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "trzaskowski" or fiore_palace = "left" or fiore_palace = "centrist": The Palace cannot prosecute anybody, but it can be
asked in public why it cannot, and this one answers. That is not a case; it is
a second signature on our paperwork.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "bosak": The Palace answers instead of the prosecutors, and
it answers us. A referral described from the presidential podium as an attack on
patriots turns Braun's fortnight into a month.?]
[? if fiore_palace = "interregnum": Nobody is certain this week who could even
receive a presidential-level complaint, which is the argument against leaving an
oath unsworn, made for us by an Italian visitor.?]

What we have instead is a dated file with a case number, and the next time
somebody has to explain why this deputy was allowed to keep speaking, the
paperwork already exists and it is ours.

- @poland_hub: Continue

