    (Number(Q.far_right_street_capacity) || 38) + 2;
Q.public_trust = (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0) + 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Left funds monitoring instead of arguing with a recording";
!}

The money goes where the consequences land: a standing monitoring contact for
Jewish organisations and minority groups, legal numbers that answer at night,
and named people in the cities where Forza Nuova's Polish contacts already
organise. We say once, briefly, what the meeting was, and then we stop
supplying the clip with commentary.

It is the least visible option on the table and the only one that leaves
something behind after the news cycle. The recording still travels; Braun still
gets his fortnight; and the international far-right network in the tape carries
on booking halls, because a monitoring contract is not a policy and we do not
hold the ministry that could make it one.

- @poland_hub: Continue

@fiore_ignore
title: Refuse the amplification and say nothing
subtitle: Denies Braun the fight he came for and leaves the meeting to be reported by people with smaller audiences.
on-arrival: {!
Q.fiore_2020_response = "No response";
