    (Number(Q.progressives_dissent) || 0) + 4;
Q.public_trust = (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0) - 1;
Q.news_headline =
    "The Warsaw meeting is reported by monitoring groups and nobody else";
!}

Every hour we spend on Braun is an hour he did not have to buy, and a party of
eleven deputies does not need our platform. We let it pass.

It is reported, carefully and at length, by the people who always report it, and
read by the people who already read them. The clip finds its audience anyway, a
sentence about a rosary and a Kalashnikov enters ordinary circulation without a
single reply attached to it, and our own progressive organisers want to know
what exactly the party is saving itself for.

- @poland_hub: Continue
